From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Restore original effects loaders and particle flow outside legacy diagnostics
Upstream-base: dc238202b310059d80791d0140dee37f27b9a3bf

Keep matching retail methods, requests and fixed colour sampling. Confine copied
registration/simulation representations to an explicitly named diagnostic. Native
fabs and the real matrix carrier are compiler boundaries only; raw effects
record endian/pointer transport remains an explicit runtime prerequisite.

